<title>USA: US Medical to sell remaining stake to Metrax.</title>
<headline>US Medical to sell remaining stake to Metrax.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Medical Products Inc said it has entered into talks with privately-held Metrax Medical Ind regarding the sale of the remaining 20 percent in the company that Metrax does not already own.</p>
<p>Earlier the company said it has entered talks to sell certain assets to Hayes Medical.</p>
<p>Metrax Medical currently owns about 80 percent of the outstanding stock of US Medical.</p>
